       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-DYN-REMESH.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DYN-REMESH-PROOFS.
           05  WS-EULER-INVAR-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TRIANGLE-QUALITY-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DELAUNAY-SWAP-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-REMESH-LATENCY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DYN-REMESH-SEAL-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-DYN-REMESH-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-REMESH-PROVEN        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-REMESH-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-EULER-AND-QUALITY.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-SWAP-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-REMESH-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-EULER-AND-QUALITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-EULER-INVAR-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TRIANGLE-QUALITY-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-SWAP-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DELAUNAY-SWAP-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REMESH-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-REMESH-PROOFS.
           IF WS-EULER-INVAR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TRIANGLE-QUALITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DELAUNAY-SWAP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-REMESH-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-DYN-REMESH-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-REMESH-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-REMESH-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-REMESH-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-REMESH-CODE.
